# Market data.
#
# Pages: set the GitHub Actions secret POLYGON_API_KEY so the deploy embeds
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POLYGON_API_KEY into the browser bundle.
#
# iOS: copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in NEXT_PUBLIC_POLYGON_API_KEY before
# `npm run build:ios`. Next loads .env.local automatically. Without it the key compiles
# to "" and there is NO fallback behind Yahoo — one Yahoo failure clears the whole board
# (see STOCK_SCANNER_APP_MEMORY.md, "Polygon is load-bearing").
POLYGON_API_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_POLYGON_API_KEY=

# Optional owned CORS proxy (Cloudflare Worker — workers/quote-proxy/)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_QUOTE_PROXY_URL=https://your-worker.workers.dev

# Optional alias if using Massive.com rebrand credentials
# MASSIVE_API_KEY=
